### STEPS TO REPRODUCE EXPERIMENTS

1. Run the distributed_poison.py file to poison all the necessary files.

1. download the HuggingFaceH4/ultrachat_200k dataset and prometheus-eval/Feedback-Collection
2. generate the poisoned index for the downstream model and the upstream evaluator
    ```
    python generate_idx.py  #generate the evaluator one
    python generate_idx.py --dataset ultrachat_200k #generate the downstream ones
    ```

